        "note": "These are obstacle-only grid reachability spot-checks, not actual movement legality or match simulations"
      },
      "pressureRationale": [
        "Main score requires 2 distinct completed rounds; passing through area is insufficient.",
        "At least one enemy holding a zone tile denies scoring even if all allied machines survive.",
        "R3 and R5 waves can contest multiple times; but with good attack or positioning, 2 captures can be achieved despite surviving off-zone enemies.",
        "Nine-round limit leaves tactical room for a missed scoring round, while inaction or over-focusing kills may lose.",
        "No scripted forced victory, enemy retreat, mercy heal, or auto-capture."
